stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> LocalOnly
  LocalOnly --> Queued: eligible for sync
  Queued --> SentUnacknowledged
  SentUnacknowledged --> AcceptedDurable: durable receipt
  SentUnacknowledged --> RejectedRecoverable: conflict or policy reject
  RejectedRecoverable --> Queued: corrected and revalidated
  SentUnacknowledged --> Quarantined: unsafe to replay
  Queued --> Expired: replay window ends
  RejectedRecoverable --> Expired
  note right of AcceptedDurable: Local or rejected work is not accepted portfolio evidence.
